    "No direct experimental bioavailability data for the query molecule.",
    "The closest analogue has only moderate Morgan similarity (0.47), and the query's pyrazine carboxamide differs from glimepiride's pyrrolidinone amide, which could affect absorption or transporter interactions."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

